// Rows 1-4: orbs with empties at (1,4), (2,4) and (4,4); Row 3,5 is Annulment, Row 5,5 is Mirror.
// Row 5: separator row (5,1-5,4 EMPTY, 5,5 Mirror). Rows 6-7: shards in orb occurrence order.
var EG_CURRENCY_COLS = 5;
